  - nodeId: li_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Czwartek. Declan zbiera kuchni\u0119 przy wydawce. W r\u0119ku kartka."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: I won't dress it up. We're down forty percent. I can keep this kitchen open if two people go. Or if everyone takes fewer hours.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: Dwie osoby. Na kartce nie ma nazwisk. Jeszcze.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - dress
    - forty
    - percent
    - fewer
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch4_mentor_bartek
    branchNodeId: li_bartek
    nextNodeId: li_choice
  - nodeId: li_bartek
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Bartek stoi przy zlewie, przy kt\xF3rym Kuba uczy\u0142 go zeskrobywa\u0107 resztki. Patrzy w pod\u0142og\u0119."
    - speakerId: bartek
      language: 0
      text: "Ja jestem ostatni, to ja wylec\u0119 pierwszy. Taka jest zasada, prawda?"
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: li_choice
  - nodeId: li_choice
    lines: []
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Oddaj\u0119 swoje soboty, \u017Ceby nikt nie musia\u0142 odchodzi\u0107."
      targetNodeId: li_share
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Milcz\u0119. Ka\u017Cdy ma swoje rachunki."
      targetNodeId: li_quiet
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "M\xF3wi\u0119 Declanowi, \u017Ce Bartek jest lepszy, ni\u017C ja by\u0142em na pocz\u0105tku."
      targetNodeId: li_vouch
      requiredFlag: ch4_mentor_bartek
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: li_share
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Po Kubie r\u0119k\u0119 podnosi drugi kucharz, potem kelnerka. Declan skre\u015Bla sobie pensj\u0119 na pa\u017Adziernik."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Ah, sure look. Nobody goes. Not this month.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Czterdzie\u015Bci euro mniej w tygodniu. W zamian nikt nie stoi jutro z reklam\xF3wk\u0105 pod drzwiami."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - month
    - goes
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_sure_look
    setFlags:
