  - nodeId: li_vouch
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Better than you were? Kooba, you broke four plates your first week.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: Trzy. Ale nie poprawiam go.
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: ...Fine. Bartek stays. He's your responsibility. Again.
    teachVocabularyWords:
